# mtr-style list of disabled tests: <test> : <reason>

# disabled on MariaDB (the only server now; the reasons are the differences in
# docs/mariadb-differences.md)
destination_offline: MariaDB has no offline_mode
errors: toggles gtid_mode (MySQL GTID machinery; asof is an open point, see PLAN.md)
table_type_vector: MariaDB VECTOR(n) has a fixed dimension; the tests store vectors of different lengths (the suite maps VECTOR to BLOB)
procedure_param_out: VECTOR procedure parameters (see table_type_vector)
procedure_param_inout: VECTOR procedure parameters (see table_type_vector)
table_filter_object: filters on a VECTOR column (see table_type_vector)
field_filters: renders a VECTOR column (see table_type_vector)
document_etags: PUTs a VECTOR column (see table_type_vector)
procedure_feed_datatypes: VECTOR procedure results (see table_type_vector)
